Subject: [PATCH] A waiting step goes on after 3 s (freeze breaker)

RetroFE's steps (filter change, highlight, menu jump, back ...) wait for the page to be idle. On
the pedestal a page stayed busy for minutes (PLAYLIST_EXIT at 11:39 never finished) and every input
was ignored. A waiting step now goes on after 3 s even if the page is still busy, and logs a
warning naming the step, so the busy part can be found. The plain idle menu is not affected.
---
